<title>SRI LANKA: Richard six-mth net marginally up.</title>
<headline>Richard six-mth net marginally up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Richard Pieris &amp; Co Ltd for the six months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>		   6 months 1996     6 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	 740.95    vs     703.53</p>
<p>    Net profit	48.30    vs	41.76</p>
<p>    Tax provision    4.10    vs	 8.85</p>
<p>NOTE - Richard Pieris is the holding company for a group that manufactures and distributes rubber products, agricultural and household equipment, and manages estates.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
